title Vinyl: Clear all asks first ("Clear the queue?", the toolkit's dialog: Cancel is its Primary, so Enter cancels, as Esc and the header's Esc do; Y or a tap on Clear clears all but the playing track)
sizes 640x480
# the deck's own density (11.3 px/mm) leaves the approved 640x480 layout's touch rows 70 px, under the 7 mm (79 px):
# owner rule R-4, listed in qa-info.txt; the scene runs at a 3.5-inch 640x480 panel's 9.01 px/mm (the harness's own
# 480x640), whose 7 mm (63 px) the rows hold, the toolkit header as on the deck (56 px)
ppmm 901
env VINYL_DEMO 1

wait 1000
key q
wait 400
key c
wait 300
shot 01-queue-clear-ask
expect esc
expect text "Clear the queue?"
expect text "Cancel"
expect text "Y = Clear, Enter or Esc = Cancel"
key enter
wait 300
expect notext "Clear the queue?"
key c
wait 300
expect text "Clear the queue?"
key esc
wait 300
expect notext "Clear the queue?"
expect text "3 OF 20, 1 H 24 MIN LEFT"
# the header's Esc while it shows: it only cancels (design QA run 4, D-30), the queue page stays
tap "Clear all"
wait 300
expect text "Clear the queue?"
tap "Esc"
wait 300
expect notext "Clear the queue?"
expect text "3 OF 20, 1 H 24 MIN LEFT"
tap "Clear all"
wait 300
expect text "Clear the queue?"
tap "Clear"
wait 400
shot 02-queue-cleared
expect notext "Clear the queue?"
expect text "1 OF 1, 3 MIN LEFT"
expect noquit
